window.products.push({"id":354006,"name":"3 Sizes Heart Silicone Molds for Chocolate Bombs, Diamond Heart Shaped Cake Mold, Heart Candy Molds Silicone Mini (Large Medium Small Set)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DdASUIiHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IDEAL SIZE FOR BAKING - Our diamond heart silicone molds set have mini small large three dimensions which are the most often used and favorite sizes, provide you much more pleasant options. Geometric heart molds for chocolate, candy, cocoa bombs, cake toppers, ice cubes and even wax melts, soaps, suitable for any festivals and occasions, such as Valentines day, Thanksgiving day, birthday parties and baby showers, events UNIQUE DESIGN - Compared with normal heart chocolate molds of other brand, our heart silicone molds have unique 3D geometric shape, your chocolate and candy will look more realistic and eye-catching. In addition, professional geometric heart molds with special design at the bottom keeps the entire product balanced and firm, fairly easy to use and cut your baking time in half CLEANS IN SECONDS AND DISHWASHER SAFE - As you know people always get frustrated by cleaning cheap silicone molds for leftover residue. With non stick surface, our heart shaped chocolate molds are easy to demold, your chocolate will pop out smoothly with good detailed shape and have many geometric angles. After use, just simply put the silicone cake mold set into dishwasher, it comes out like new! If you don't use an automatic machine, cleaning it by hot soapy water is also a breeze MULTIPURPOSE - These mini small large chocolate candy molds allow you to create homemade healthy sugar-free and low-carb chocolate and candy for your kids and families, keep a great healthy diet. You can personalize foods or wax melts for customers as small business, the mini small large heart molds set may also serve as ideal gifts for friends and colleagues, giving them a sweet unforgettable baking memory FOOD GRADE - Made of extra thick durable premium materials, our 3d heart chocolate molds are BPA free and sturdy, can be used numerous times with no problems. Heat resistant from -40℉ to +446℉, these breakable diamond heart molds set can be allowed for using in the freezer, oven and micro-wave, don't change shape or have plastic smell afterwards. We follow a strict set of specifications and quality standards, however, if you have any problem with our 3D heart molds set, please contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DdASUIiHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fimary","source_asin":"B08TBVCV1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TBVCV1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TBVCV1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
