window.products.push({"id":354131,"name":"Halo Fuse Electric Blanket - Lightweight, Durable Heated Throw - Blanket for the Everyday Use - Soft & Plush Sherpa-Lined Warmer, 50 x 60 inches, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-fzVmbvgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ever wished to feel warm and cozy while lounging in the sofa? Hanging out in the living room with your loved ones is always a delightful experience. It doesn’t even matter if you’re watching TV, playing board games, or simply talking. Aside from being an ideal place to get-together, the lounge area is a great spot to take naps, too. Wouldn’t it be lovely to have a warm blanket to keep you nice and snug as you lie down? Stay comfortable while hanging out in any room with the Halo Fuse Electric Blanket. Is your regular blanket unable to keep you warm throughout the night? Or, are you yearning for a sofa throw that can truly make you feel soothed and relaxed? If you said yes to both or any of the questions, then our electric blanket is suitable for you. Our irresistibly soft blanket is the perfect lounging companion. Use it while watching films, reading books, writing, doing homework, or cuddling with that special someone. It comes with an attached remote, so you can easily adjust heat levels to your comfort. Another thing to rave about this household accessory is its compact and lightweight build. You’ll never have to worry about it feeling overly heavy against your body, or struggle to pack it for travel. Feel free to bring it on your next road trip or when you’re sleeping over at a friend’s house. Need more reasons to get this warm and snug living room blanket? Check out these awesome benefits: ✅ Can stay in excellent condition even with regular use ✅ Built with an auto-shutoff feature for safety ✅ Great choice for winter, spring, and autumn ✅ Crafted from skin-safe and hygienic materials ✅ Has a modern minimalist design Wrap yourself in the warm embrace of a heated throw. Add the Halo Fuse Electric Blanket to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-fzVmbvgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Halo Fuse","source_asin":"B086HSP8CL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HSP8CL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HSP8CL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
