window.products.push({"id":354166,"name":"Rosas Corp Portable Blender, 13 Oz Personal Size Blender Juicer CUP for Smoothies and Shakes, Mini Blender USB Rechargeable With Six Blades for Outdoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JN4aArhtL._AC_SL1288_.jpg","description":"Rosas Corp personal mini juicer blender is very lightweight, easy to carry and portable for travelling. Powered with 2000mAh battery the mini juicer can run 15-20 times with a single charge. The upgraded 3D 6 blades can effortlessly pulverizes fruits, vegetables into amazing smoothies and shakes. The blender comes with USB cable that can be recharged in a variety of ways, like charging by power bank, AC Adapter and computer, and charging time is 3-5 hours. How to Use: Step 1 Cut the fruit into small pieces about 1.5-2.3cm. (Crushed ice is acceptable.)Step 2 Add milk or water according to your flavor.(Don't exceed 4/5 of the bottle).Step 3 Hold the button for 2 second to start, shake the machine to make delicious juice just need 30 seconds. Safety Guide: 1) This travel blender is not suitable for bullet-proof coffee or hot drink more than 50 degree which will be easy cause leakage, please don't use for that purpose.2) Don't let the charging base get wet, If it gets wet, please dry it with a dry towel.3) Don't put your hands inside your blender or try to touch the blades.4) Don't use your blender when charging or run your blender without anything inside.5) Fully charge your blender 4~5 hours when first using, then 2 hour is ok for every charge.6) Smart Power Reminder : When Red light on,0-20% power left; Blue light 21-80%;White light,81-100% Full power.7) To control the capacity of juice under the 70%-80% cup body capacity is appropriate. Package Includes: Portable BlenderUser ManualMicro USB CableAdapter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JN4aArhtL._AC_SL1288_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosas","source_asin":"B091G3PFZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091G3PFZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091G3PFZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
