window.products.push({"id":354450,"name":"Vewinly Halloween Decorations Window Clings,76pcs Double-Side Removable Pumpkin Spider Bat Ghost Witch Halloween Windows Decals Stickers for Halloween","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NP24lJo7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Premium Material: Double-sided Halloween window static stickers are made of high quality PVC material, reusable, durable, non-toxic, environmental friendly, waterproof, safe for children and kids. And you can move multiple times to change the position of the window decals, so as achieving the best effect. Double-sided printing: Our Halloween window clings decorations are double-side printed, When you paste it on the window, the color effect displayed inside and outside of the window is the same bright and prefect. Perfect for glass windows, refrigerator doors, glass doors, shop window pane, or any other smooth surface Easy To Use: These Halloween window decals are Adopting the principle of electrostatic adsorption. no need glue. Before you stick the window clings on the window, you need to wipe clean the windows that need to be pasted, spray a little water, water will make them stick better. (TIPS: Please use it in a flat and smooth place, such as: doors, windows, mirrors, refrigerator doors, microwave ovens.) Wide Applications: This Halloween window sticker decoration is perfect for Halloween parties, holiday indoor decorations, kitchen refrigerator decals. blend well with other Halloween decors to bring out spooky feel. They are also fun gifts for kids,your friends and your families. It will help add more Halloween day atmosphere. Happy Halloween： We are a professional sticker manufacturer, providing you with the best quality products and services. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. Our friendly customer service always stands behind our product and reply all email within 24 hours. Wish you have a happy and fun Halloween","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NP24lJo7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vewinly","source_asin":"B0B7R7QW82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7R7QW82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7R7QW82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
