window.products.push({"id":354489,"name":"Reusable Lunch Bag for Kids Parent-Child Small Insulated Lunch Box Easy Cleaning Cooler Lunch Tote Bags for School Girls Boys Children Student","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bGKexI9ML._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Dimension: 9.4 x 6.3 x 6.3 in . We are insist on providing your kids a healthy lunch with our Eco-friendly ,easy-to-carry lunch box. Big enough to hold the lunch container for your kids, keep in packed state and small enough for your kids to carry easily with the lightweight design Insulated: Made with durable 600D Polyester, 5mm PE foam padding and the interior insulated PEVA lining to keep food stay cold/warm/fresh for hours, perfect for on-the-go meals, picnics, road trips, lunch at the office, the school, the beach and more! Leakproof & Waterproof: Extra thick soft EVA liner and the heat-welded seams to guard against leaks and easy to clean. If sauce spills inside, just wipe it off with wet cloth or napkins. Premium composite waterproof fabric is resistant to dirty and abrasion, protecting your lunch and items inside from occasional splatters or light rain Structure: lunch bag has 1 main zipper compartment to carry lunch, snacks, drinks and fruits, 1 front pocket for tableware, keys, phones etc. comfort-grip handle and detachable shoulder strap.You can carry the bag by the handles when you use the top handle, and also it could be used as a crossbody bag or shoulder bag, Its durable and easy to pull zippers will never trouble you Note; This is the small lunch bag for kids in the parent-child lunch bag set, and the parent-child set (large + small) needs to be purchased separately for the large lunch bag for Mommy.-Manufacturer recommended age: 5+ years About the Brand;SAMERIO/SANNE trademarks are the same company brand, which are shipped alternately, and the quality of the goods is the same","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bGKexI9ML._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMERIO","source_asin":"B07WR2N7WY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WR2N7WY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WR2N7WY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
