window.products.push({"id":354642,"name":"Yummy Sam Thermal Coffee Carafe Stainless Steel 68oz(2 Lifter) Double Walled Vacuum Coffee Thermos Water Beverage Dispenser 12 Hour Heat Retention/24 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MbNOfhtJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Quality & Durability】: Constructed with BPA Free detachable lid and durable 18/8 food-grade stainless steel interior and exterior, our coffee carafe can be used as a tea/coffee thermos dispenser, milk carafe, creamer carafe, juice, wine, hot water pitcher. 【Temperature Retention】: There is nothing better than the aroma of a fresh cup of coffee or the scent of an herbal tea infusion,but many carafes fail to lock in the flavor. Our thermal coffee carafe is designed with double-wall vacuum insulation, preserving heat for up to 12 hours and cold for up to 24 hours, when the lid is closed, the warmer the water, the better the insulation effect. Locking in the aroma and the perfect temperature of your drink! (Note: Please make sure it is sealed to keep hot.) 【Leak Proof】: Our leak-proof lid is designed with a new insulated and air-tight structure, making it always locks in the correct place. Our vacuum thermal carafe will not leak one single drip even with a slight tilt. 【Press Button Technology】: Pour spout opens easily with push-button ease, making one-handed pouring of this coffee carafe simple.Comes with a free cleaning brush for your convenience,the perfect gift set for your special and loved ones. 【Warranty】: We provide a 2-year warranty, buy with confidence! If the stainless steel thermal coffee carafe has a dent when received, please contact us freely, we will solve it for you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MbNOfhtJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yummy Sam","source_asin":"B081JP9P1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081JP9P1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081JP9P1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":354643,"name":"Cybrtrayd Baby Bunny Pop Easter Chocolate Candy Mold with 50 4.5-Inch Lollipop Sticks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nIkZLkuPL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques. To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision. Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nIkZLkuPL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B00HJM4MJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HJM4MJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HJM4MJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
