window.products.push({"id":354728,"name":"YOUHONG 5 Piece Airplane Decor Aviation Art SR-71 Blackbird Strategic Airplane Wall Decor Airplane Wall Art Fighter Jet Poster Military Wall Decor Air","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cBc9xTd5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✈️Airplane Canvas Wall Art Size: 10x12inchx2PCS, 10x16inchx2PCS, 10x24inchx1PCS. Delivery Time: Within Two Weeks (Unless special circumstances). 💘High Quality Airplane Art Material: 1. high-quality canvas: moisture-proof, UV-resistant, thick and friendly-environment coating; 2. sturdy frame: thick, not easy to deform, light. 📦Packing: Jet wall art will be packed with FILM PLASTIC and CARTON. Each panel of canvas has been already stretched to solid wooden frame of hook ready to hang. 💌Good Service: Supply with pre-sale and after-sale service to ensure you buy it without any worry! 🎁Aviation Poster: A great gift idea for your family, friends, lovers or workmates, etc. A perfect military art for living room, bedroom, home, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cBc9xTd5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUHONG","source_asin":"B09P8DKNFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P8DKNFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P8DKNFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":354729,"name":"Steamer For Clothes,Handheld Clothes Steamers,180ml Powerful Wrinkle Remover Garment Fabric Steamer.Portable,Compact-Travel/Home.Automatic Shut-Off Sa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614a2ix0O6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Going to a business trip? Attending a weekend wedding? Need to bring a suit? Need a compact size steamer for home use?  Our compact clothes steamer is perfect for travel and home use.  Boy do we have the steamer for you. We got sick and tired of using the traditional big steamer, they take way too much space, are bulky too handle and are a pain to move around. Now you just need to pack this small steamer in your suitcase and you are good to go without having to worry about your clothes ending up all winrkled! Features: 180ml larger volume tank Fast to heat up and safe to use Easy to carry thanks to its compact size Can be used on any fabrics and eliminate wrinkles fast and effortlessly New nozzle design provides powerful steam and extrem precision How to use? Step 1: Twist the top-off in a clockwise manner, then add water to the tank, and screw the top back on. (Note: the water should not surpass the maximum indicated level) Step 2: Switch on the power via the handle. A red LED light will glow when the steamer powers on. Step 3: After 80 seconds, the water has heaten up, and you’re ready to iron!  Step 4: After use, please switch the power off and unplug the steamer from the wall outlet. Pack it up wherever you want! Specifications: Operating Voltage: 120V Rated Power: 800W Rated frequency: 60Hz or 50Hz Product net weight: 580g Steam length: 750ml Steam temperature: 90-99degrees Package: 1* Garment Steamer  1*Travel Pouch 1* User Manual 1* Warning Card 1*Glove Tips: Never turn the unit upside down, or tilt past a 45-degree angle especially when the unit is ON.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614a2ix0O6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAYFULI","source_asin":"B07H3QVXMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H3QVXMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H3QVXMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":354730,"name":"Teabloom Stovetop Safe Glass Teapot with Removable Infuser (40oz/1200ml) and Four Double Walled Glass Cups (5oz/150ml) - Classica Tea Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fRRK47d5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE LAST TEA SET YOU WILL EVER NEED. The Classica Teapot was designed to be extremely functional and versatile for years of everyday use. Remove the stainless steel parts and boil water in the microwave, eliminating the need for a separate kettle. You may also boil water or keep tea warm on a stovetop. Clean up quickly in the dishwasher. Generous 40-oz. capacity brews up to eight 5-oz. teacups. Includes four insulated double-walled glass cups (5 oz / 150 ml). DELIGHT YOUR SENSES WITH CLASSIC DESIGN. The Classica’s simple, clean lines and perfect proportions delight the eye and blend beautifully with any décor. Extra-thick, crystal clear borosilicate glass is strong yet lightweight and feels wonderful in hand. Constructed of the highest-quality materials that never lose their brand-new appearance, this is the “little black dress” of teapots. ENJOY EXCEPTIONAL DURABILITY AND QUALITY. Discerning tea lovers know the benefits of heat-resistant borosilicate glass. We’ve gone the extra mile and constructed the Classica with extra-thick, 2mm glass and an extra-wide handle. The sturdy stainless steel infuser insert and attached lid will never rust, corrode, or discolor. GIFT-GIVING MADE EASY. Whether you need a gift for newlyweds, graduates, friends, relatives – or yourself! – the Classica is a tasteful, quality choice that shows how much you care. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED. Teabloom is the supplier of choice for five-star hotels worldwide, and manufacturer of the world’s largest selection of glass teapots. Founded on years of experience in the tea business, we are dedicated to customer service and stand behind our products with a full one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fRRK47d5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teabloom","source_asin":"B08JV6JZ55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JV6JZ55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JV6JZ55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
