window.products.push({"id":354866,"name":"MAWA Ft Reston Lloyd Silhouette Series Non-Slip Space Saving Clothes Hanger for Shirts and Dresses, Style 41/F, Set of 10, White, Pack of 10, 10 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AKqy1kV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAWA is the most unique, high end quality hanger on the market place. Don't be fooled by Chinese copies of the Origil MAWA hanger. MAWA hangers are made in Germany with the use of the finest quality materials and dedication to safe environmental manufacturing practices. This steel hanger is a long lasting clothing hanger that your clothing deserves. We all spend a good amount of money on our clothing. So why are we entrusting our favorite shirt, sweater or pants to a 1 cent hanger? Currently on the market the only “high end” hangers on the market is wooden hangers. Typically wooden hangers take up a lot of space, and have little to no features. MAWA hangers are unlike anything on the market because they are made to fit YOUR clothing needs and sizes. The hanger market hasn’t offered customers many choices. Typically you are offered a standard hanger or a hanger with a pant bar, that’s it. How is that supposed to apply to all the different shapes of clothing on the market? The answer is, it’s can’t. MAWA Hangers offer rrow, standard and wide hanger options. We offer hangers that support shirt collars/polo’s, promises sweaters won’t get shoulder lumps, and suites maintain their shape. Choose the hanger collection that works for each style of clothing in your closet. Choose from Silhouette, Euro, Body Form, Pant/Clips, & accessory Collections. Each hanger from the different lines all will hang from the clothing bar evenly to give you a clean professiol closet appearance. Each hanger is made of carton steel that is long lasting, durable, and hold up to 8 lbs. They are coated with a skin safe PVC material that is sure to grip. Unlike felt covered hangers you can dry your wet clothing on our hangers without losing their grip. No matter how many cloths you have in your closet your clothing will stay on the hangers. So you will never have odd articles of clothing on the bottom of your closet again. MAWA has created the highest quality coating to protect your clothing and skin. Each hanger is free of phthalate, formaldehyde, azo dyes, lead, mercury, cadmium and so much more. Our formula is as well because it’s manufactured from strictly ecological perspectives. So what are you waiting for, give MAWA a try and give your clothing a hanger that will last and give you the benefits and features you deserve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AKqy1kV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAWA","source_asin":"B0BC4GSJ9V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC4GSJ9V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC4GSJ9V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
