window.products.push({"id":354874,"name":"ELINEN 100% Supima Cotton Sheets 600 Thread Count,Bed Sheet Set Full Size 4 Pieces,Soft & Silky Sateen Weave, Fits Mattress Up to 18'',Deep Pocket, Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":105.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ABlGUjqoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【WORLD'S FINEST COTTONS】Not all cottons are created equal. Supima cotton is a superior type of cotton grown in the USA. It represents less than 1% of cotton grown in the world. What makes Supima unique to other cottons is the extra-long staple fiber that gives the cotton its premium properties: Strength, Softness and Color retention. Supima is superior to Egyptian cotton and pima cotton. 【Full Size Package Contents】Full size 4 pieces bed sheet set includes 1 Flat Sheet: 81\" x 96\"(206 x 244cm); 1 Fitted Sheet: 54\" x 76\" + 16\"(137 x 193 + 40cm), with deep pockets to fitted mattress up to 18\" (45cm) and 2 Standard Pillowcases: 20\" x 30\"(50 x 76cm). Coordinate with the extra matching pillowcases (sold in our store) to complete your family needs if necessary. 【Luxuriously Feeling】Feel the difference - sleep better and wake up each morning feeling refreshed and full of energy. Silky soft, breathable and exquisite, specially woven ultra-fine Supima cotton sateen for ultimate comfort bed sheets you can find. Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, vacation home. Great gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas. 【OEKO-TEX MADE IN GREEN Certification】All the products follow ISO STANDARDS and have MADE IN GREEN label. Every inch of our fabric conforms top performance standards, following the best processes and international quality standards. Silky soft and comfortable touch for maximum satisfaction, expertly tailored design adds elegance and sophistication to your bedroom. 【Easy To Care】The sheets and pillowcases are fade, stain and shrink resistant that make you can safely clean it. Machine wash in cold water with similar colors. Warm iron when necessary. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach. These beautiful sheets are skin friendly, hypoallergenic and made to last long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ABlGUjqoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELINEN","source_asin":"B085QP1L88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085QP1L88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085QP1L88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
