window.products.push({"id":354889,"name":"NOVICA Hand Carved Albesia Wood Ocean Animal Themed Coat Rack Key Holder With Agel Grass Cord, 'Serangan Turtles'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813FUTQMhXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Named after Serangan Island in Bali, this wood coat rack is made of albesia wood with an agel grass cord for hanging on a wall. Hand carved by Indonesian artist Putu Suserini, this coat rack features four turtles with blue stripes. This coat rack is excellent for livening up any home or beach cottage.  - Features a rustic, rugged finish - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly   About our Artist: 'My name is Putu Suserini and I was born in Bali. My brother taught me wood crafting. I realized that no matter how difficult the situation is, we could solve it if we combat laziness and live simply. My husband helps find our materials and also does the finishing while I manage orders and coordinate the work with the eight artisans who assist us. They are just like my own family and live and eat together here in our workshop.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813FUTQMhXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01JKGANVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JKGANVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JKGANVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
