window.products.push({"id":354893,"name":"SUPNON Elastic Edged Waterproof Table Cover Tablecloths Kitchen Decor, Fits for Round Tables - Easter Theme with Ears of Bunny No0024 Tablecloth Size ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W8Fsa6gcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We sell product with good quality and price. We attach great importance to each feedback from customers. Welcome to pick and buy in our store. Description: - Dress up your table for that special occasion while protecting the table from spills, dents or scratches. - Refresh any worn or dated table. - Waterproof , non easy damage, can be used both indoor or outdoor. - With this decorative tablecloth, you can easily dress up your table and help your family and friends enjoy any occasion at home, party, hotel, restaurant and coffee shop. Specification: - Materials: Polyester - Shape: Round - Tablecloth Dimension: ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 36\"(Fit for 24.2\"-28.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 40\"(Fit for 28.2\"-32.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 44\"(Fit for 32.2\"-36.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 48\"(Fit for 36.2\"-40.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 50\"(Fit for 38.2\"-42.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 54\"(Fit for 42.2\"-46.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 60\"(Fit for 48.2\"-52.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 64\"(Fit for 52.2\"-56.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 68\"(Fit for 56.2\"-60.1\" Diameter Table) ❤ Tablecloth Diameter 70\"(Fit for 58.2\"-62.1\" Diameter Table) 1 Piece Tablecloth - Hand-washing and machine washing are all available,but we suggest hand-washing and not dewatering, you can medium temperature ironing. Note: Please allow 1-3mm differs due to manual measurement. Due to the different display and different light, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. Thank for your understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W8Fsa6gcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPNON","source_asin":"B08KZRHHDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KZRHHDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KZRHHDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
