window.products.push({"id":354902,"name":"Ancient Cookware, Indian Hammered Copper Punjabi Handi, Small, 4.5 Inch, 14 Ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iQL4QMSAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you enjoy Indian Cusine, and serving your table in an authentic way, you will love with our double layer, Hammered Copper Punjabi Handi. Length 4.5 inch, Width 4.5, Height 3, Diameter 4 and Capacity 14 oz (filled comfortably without overflowing). With it's rounded shape, this authentic and decorative dish is perfect for serving dal and lentils. It is hand-crafted with two layers of metal which actually help to preserve the dish hot for a long period of time. The inner layer is made of the highest quality stainless steel, with the outer layer made from copper which is hand hammered in a uniquely Indian style giving the dish an added beauty. Care The copper Handi should be hand washed with mild soap and a soft sponge or wash cloth, drying it immediately. You should not use steel wool or scouring pads as they may damage or scratch the surface. You should also avoid harsh detergent or dishwashers as these may accelerate the oxidation process of the outer copper lining and reduce the life span of the dish. Over time, the outer copper layer will naturally darken and develop what is called a “patina”. To remove the patina, you can rub the outside with a vinegar-salt solution. To keep the exterior looking new, you can also use a copper polish and follow the manufacturer’s instruction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iQL4QMSAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancient Cookware","source_asin":"B019JAMMAM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019JAMMAM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019JAMMAM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
