window.products.push({"id":354931,"name":"CHICOLOGY 3/4 to 1 inch Diameter Pole for Drapes Finials, Window Decor Elegant Finished in Brass, Bronze, Nickel & Black Curtain Rods, 66 to 120 inche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511UPDjz8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Style and Quality at an amazing Value. Try Chicology Curtain Rods as the perfect complement to your new curtains or drapery. The finial designs and finishes are versatile without being plain, and allow you to create a stunning accent to your home. Each drapery rod is made of high quality 100% steel , and will be a lasting addition to your home decor update. Each curtain rod is flexible with a telescoping design. You can easily pick the range that will fit your windows, and it will be easy to install them to create the look you want. Install them wider and taller than your windows to create a more dramatic look. It will also prevent side lights from coming in by creating enhanced privacy and maximum coverage. They are available in 3 different width types: 24 to 48-inches, 48 to 86-inches, and 66 to 120-inches . For the larger two sizes (greater than 48 inches), additional centre support bracket is included for more stability. Please note different styles come in either 3/4 inch diameter or 1 1/8 inch diameter. Installation is a very easy 3-step process of simply installing the brackets at their appropriate height and width - make sure they are level! They will of course work perfectly well with any type of curtains or drapery, from tailored pleats, pinch pleat, inverted pleat, grommet, goblet, rod pocket, back tab & tab top curtains. Check out Chicology Blinds & Shades , as they can be the perfect backdrop to your dramatic curtain overlay. Highly versatile, effortlessly operated, and sleek styled, Chicology Curtain Rods are ideal for all window coverings from living room, dining room, bedroom, office, pool house & sunroom .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511UPDjz8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICOLOGY","source_asin":"B088CLCDWR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088CLCDWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088CLCDWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":354932,"name":"SVISTOL 5-in-1 Convertible Sleeper Chair - Folding Ottoman, Sofa Bed, Recliner, Table - Soft Fabric, Adjustable Back - Multifunctional Furniture for L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zF3cVckIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"On the lookout for a new seating furniture? When shopping for seating, most people immediately think of sofas. Some may consider getting a recliner or even an ottoman. Regardless, each one has its own unique features, and weighing them against each other can make choosing difficult. But why consider only one when you can get them all? Aside from that, you can get a bed and a myriad of nifty accessories along with the chair, too. Sleep and lounge your way to relaxation with the SVISTOL Convertible Sleeper Chair! Need an ottoman? This sleeper chair is perfect for this purpose. You can even use it as a table for drinks and snacks along with the included coasters and bamboo food tray. And because the microsuede fabric is waterproof, cleaning up drops or spills is a breeze. With a few adjustments, you can turn the ottoman into a sofa. It can also be converted into a recliner in minutes by simply putting up the footrest and adjusting the backrest. The locking mechanism ensures that the backrest stays in place no matter how long and hard you lean on it. And if you need an extra bed for your guest, you can turn this sleeper chair into one by bringing the backrest down. To complete the experience, we're throwing in an eye mask, earplugs, and a throw blanket to help guests sleep better. Here are more details about our sleeper chair: ✅ Ottoman Size: 27\"x31\"x17\" ✅ Sofa Size: 32\"x31\"x17\" inches ✅ Recliner & Bed Size: 74\"x31\"x17\" ✅ Table-ottoman Size: 27\"x31\"x17\" ✅ Weight: 51.8 lbs. Get a multifunctional furniture that lets you sit, sleep, and save space. Add the SVISTOL Convertible Sleeper Chair to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zF3cVckIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SVISTOL","source_asin":"B09LYQX5TN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYQX5TN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYQX5TN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
