window.products.push({"id":354990,"name":"Lush Decor Pink-and-Turquoise Elephant Striped 5-Piece Comforter Bed Set, Full/Queen, Pink & Turquoise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C1dxRFG3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Toddlers don’t stay little for long, so the look of their bedroom should also change with time. Gone are the days of cartoon characters, unicorns, or superheroes. What your little one needs now is something more grown up and comfier for their first big kid bedroom. While there are many options for kids' bedding sets out there, finding one that combines style, durability, and comfort is not easy. Not all beautiful queen bedding sets are designed to last while keeping your child warm and cozy. Upgrade your little one's bedroom with the Lush Decor Elephant Striped 5-Piece Comforter Bed Set. It is designed with a combination of beautiful patterns and exceptional quality, ensuring that it will last through the years.Bring a welcoming atmosphere into your child’s bedroom. The soothing pastel color scheme and refreshing design of our queen bedding set blend seamlessly with any theme or decor. The 100% polyester material feels nice and soft on the skin, allowing for a peaceful sleep experience. The gender-neutral animal print and light, breezy colors make it easy to find a queen bed set that your child will love. This comforter is also reversible, so you can change the look and feel of your space at any time. The elephant print is designed with all ages in mind, which is why we offer the same look in our daybed and quilt styles. Add the Lush Decor Elephant Striped 5-Piece Comforter Bed Set to your child's room to create a cozy, cute atmosphere for your little one.At Lush Decor, we aim to provide premium products that combine luxury, style, and affordability. All of our creations are made by talented designers that understand quality and aesthetics. Browse through our extensive line of home decor and see which ones suit your taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C1dxRFG3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B08TD9ZRLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-354990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TD9ZRLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TD9ZRLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
